arantee is made. Loading, meshing, pool construction, first use, five alternating warmups, f64/statistics/PLY serialization and verification and cleanup are excluded. Ten alternating timed pairs are retained without outlier removal. No builds/tests/scans/edits run alongside timing. Archived sources, executables, compiler, script, inputs/manifests/original PCD are checked before/after. Clocks, power, scheduling, other applications, allocator, code layout and retained pages are uncontrolled. No isolated ordering, Python conversion, C2C, browser, WASM or GPU speedup claim. No GPU model identifiers collected."
